 ame (til) on this day brings great merit and purification.\n\nA day of f
 asting from grains and beans\, devoted to Lord Vishnu. Break the fast (p
 arana) the following morning within the prescribed window.\n\nMore: http
 s://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ekadashi
