 a Paksha</i></p><p>Charity of sesame (til) on this day brings great meri
 t and purification.</p><p>A day of fasting from grains and beans\, devot
 ed to Lord Vishnu. Break the fast (<b>parana</b>) the following morning 
 within the prescribed window.</p><p><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wi
 ki/Ekadashi">More about Ekadashi &raquo\;</a></p>
